<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10006_S000J" variety="S000J">
<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_744E7_T004T" variety="T004T">
<name>EFI System (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000211600GX" category="C" type-id="800K4" name-id="065AD-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>P1605</dtccode>
<dtcname>Unstable Idling</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000211600GX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00002W900000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The DTC is output when the idle speed drops or becomes unstable from a state in which the engine load is small and the engine is idling stably. The freeze frame data, which stores the conditions when the DTC was output, can be checked using TaSCAN. Serviceability is improved by making it possible to check the engine operating condition at the time of unstable idling using the freeze frame data. Also, since unstable idling caused by running out of fuel is also detected, it is necessary to check whether the vehicle has run out of fuel before starting work.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="5.66in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction duration 3. Malfunction status 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P1605</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>5 seconds after ISC learning is completed after engine start</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine speed drops to 400r/min or less</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>-</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211600GX_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002WA00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If other DTCs are displayed, troubleshoot the corresponding DTCs first.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Since DTC P1605 differs from conventional diagnostic trouble codes, the diagnostic procedure below is described as 1 possible method.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211600GX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000211600GX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00002WB00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs by following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.48in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Only P1605 is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Other DTCs are displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211600GX_03_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000211600GX_03_0003" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211600GX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00002WC00000">
