<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the screen display of SST (TaSCAN), check the time-series freeze frame data, and check the vehicle condition at the time of unstable idling. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CD201DX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
